ata-dc-tpl=\"50\" style=\"font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--color-neutral-400);\">Como funciona</span><div data-dc-tpl=\"51\" style=\"position: relative; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, max(25% - 9px, -99900% + 759240px)), 1fr)); gap: 12px;\"><div data-dc-tpl=\"52\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"position: absolute; left: 24px; right: 24px; top: 27px; height: 1px; background: linear-gradient(to right,var(--color-accent-700),var(--color-accent-500),var(--color-accent-700));\"><span data-dc-tpl=\"53\" style=\"position: absolute; top: -2px; left: 0px; width: 5px; height: 5px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--color-accent-100); box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--color-accent); animation: 4s linear 0s infinite normal both running flow;\"></span></div><div data-dc-tpl=\"54\" style=\"position: relative; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; padding: 16px; border-radius: var(--radius-lg); background: var(--color-surface); box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);\"><span data-dc-tpl=\"55\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 24px; height: 24px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--color-bg); box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px var(--color-accent-500); font-size: 11px; color: var(--color-accent-100); font-feature-settings: &quot;tnum&quot;; animation: 4s ease-in-out 0s infinite normal none running npulse;\">1</span><span data-dc-tpl=\"56\" style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500;\">Export</span><span data-dc-tpl=\"57\" style=\"font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 20px; color: var(--color-neutral-300);\">Configuração exportada do IBM Event Streams</span></div><div data-dc-tpl=\"58\" style=\"position: relative; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; padding: 16px; border-radius: var(--radius-lg); background: var(--color-surface); box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);\"><span data-dc-tpl=\"59\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 24px; height: 24px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--color-bg); box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px var(--color-accent-500); font-size: 11px; color: var(--color-accent-100); font-feature-settings: &quot;tnum&quot;; animation: 4s ease-in-out 1s infinite normal none running npulse;\">2</span><span data-dc-tpl=\"60\" style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500;\">50 regras</span><span data-dc-tpl=\"61\" style=\"font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 20px; color: var(--color-neutral-300);\">Tradução de tópicos e ACLs para Confluent</span></div><div data-dc-tpl=\"62\" style=\"position: relative; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; padding: 16px; border-radius: var(--radius-lg); background: var(--color-surface); box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);\"><span data-dc-tpl=\"63\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 24px; height: 24px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--color-bg); box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px var(--color-accent-500); font-size: 11px; color: var(--color-accent-100); font-feature-settings: &quot;tnum&quot;; animation: 4s ease-in-out 2s infinite normal none running npulse;\">3</span><span data-dc-tpl=\"64\" style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500;\">Gates de segurança</span><span data-dc-tpl=\"65\" style=\"font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 20px; color: var(--color-neutral-300);\">Validação antes de qualquer entrega</span></div><div data-dc-tpl=\"66\" style=\"position: relative; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; padding: 16px; border-radius: var(--radius-lg); background: var(--color-surface); box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);\"><span data-dc-tpl=\"67\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 24px; height: 24px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--color-bg); box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px var(--color-accent-500); font-size: 11px; color: var(--color-accent-100); font-feature-settings: &quot;tnum&quot;; animation: 4s ease-in-out 3s infinite normal none running npulse;\">4</span><span data-dc-tpl=\"68\" style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500;\">Pacote testado</span><span data-dc-tpl=\"69\" style=\"font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 20px; color: var(--color-neutral-300);\">Scripts prontos para executar</span></div></div></div><p data-dc-tpl=\"70\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 26px; color: var(--color-neutral-100); max-width: 80ch;\"><strong data-dc-tpl=\"71\" style=\"font-weight: 500; color: var(--color-accent-100);\">Primeiro caso:</strong> seguradora de grande porte, 3 clusters, 216 tópicos e 100 bindings de ACL traduzidos.</p></div></section><section data-dc-tpl=\"72\" style=\"max-width: 1200px; margin: 0px auto; padding: clamp(56px, 7vw, 88px) clamp(20px, 5vw, 72px) 0px;\"><div data-dc-tpl=\"73\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 36px; padding-top: 40px; background: linear-gradient(to right,transparent,var(--color-neutral-700) 48px calc(100% - 48px),transparent) top/100% 1px no-repeat;\"><div data-dc-tpl=\"74\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 28px 64px; align-items: flex-end;\"><div data-dc-tpl=\"75\" style=\"flex: 1 1 380px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; min-width: 0px;\"><span data-dc-tpl=\"76\" style=\"font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--color-accent-300);\">02 · Produto</span><h2 data-dc-tpl=\"77\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-weight: 500; font-size: clamp(26px, 3vw, 36px); line-height: 1.2; letter-spacing: -0.015em;\">Infra Forge</h2><p data-dc-tpl=\"78\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 26px; color: var(--color-neutral-200); max-width: 56ch;\">Runbooks de PoC e implantação validados em lab, que outra pessoa executa sem suporte.</p></div><div data-dc-tpl=\"79\" style=\"flex: 1 1 340px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0px, 1fr)); gap: 24px; min-width: 0px;\"><div data-dc-tpl=\"80\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; padding-top: 16px; background: linear-gradient(to right,var(--color-accen